": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604360590_1087031917525550_8805671906671614868_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CQaSjKe4fV8Q7kNvwFg7g-c&_nc_oc=Adp-WuEYtwSVhYUINfe9s_0QdeV1TI__IFTrKOoyTqrITE_hueYmS4EYU0Kb6AQctMQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQnIqfV4rb9L9SYAwtqT4ed4DU775CjSnMKbBqpp1E6oA&oe=6AF73918"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_visual_search_2560x1440.png", "id": "1435727761979634", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831279_1435727765312967_1098845419077784160_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LXOARbGymw0Q7kNvwFHgPXN&_nc_oc=Adq3qva84wzqmR53Mr_qFGP3vK4uQI1rhn96YdjfCN1KG7XcjOZHPz31QV2XvEgbTos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTs_3LTPiJTHyLWQbkaD1qEY08kjiSwG42EaPzP0wkeOg&oe=6AF74A0F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_horizontal_2560x1440.png", "id": "1609180094336518", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1609180101003184_5924164961948358673_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YnKqU2n1724Q7kNvwH81sXr&_nc_oc=AdrukVl-mAmUUZVkZXJCLCllasBtsQzx5HSNEyaIb1Hn3S6xUE5-8_8UhvuBIuzunjQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSnXYMImqSsYgTPoUdlvUdkSuUIq4-_c6MX2kIIegO0HA&oe=6AF72947"}, "display_name": "HFbioVR Immersive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HFbioVR Immersive is the immersive component of HFbioVR.\n\nIt runs the rehabilitation and cognitive exercises of the HFbioVR system,\nused by physiotherapy practices, rehabilitation centres and health\nprofessionals.\n\nIt is not used on its own. The HFbioVR app handles sign-in, the patient\ndashboard and the exercise catalogue; when an exercise is started, it\nopens here in virtual reality.\n\nRequires:\n\u2022 HFbioVR installed on the same headset\n\u2022 an account issued by the clinic adopting HFbioVR\n\u2022 a network connection\n\nExercises include cognitive training (attention, working memory,\nspatial-temporal orientation, calculation) and relaxation and body\nawareness protocols. The therapist can assemble exercise sequences and\nguide them remotely during the session.", "short_description": "Immersive component of HFbioVR. It runs HFbioVR's rehabilitation and\ncognitive exercises in virtual reality. It is not used on its own: the\nHFbioVR app handles sign-in, the patient dashboard and the exercise\ncatalogue, then opens the selected exercise here. Requires HFbioVR\ninstalled on the same headset."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1101977335941039", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "HFbioVR Immersive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HFbioVR Immersive \u00e8 il componente immersivo di HFbioVR.\n\nEsegue in realt\u00e0 virtuale gli esercizi riabilitativi e cognitivi del\nsistema HFbioVR, utilizzato da studi di fisioterapia, centri di\nriabilitazione e professionisti della salute.\n\nNon si utilizza autonomamente. L'applicazione HFbioVR gestisce l'accesso,\nla dashboard del paziente e il catalogo degli esercizi; quando viene\navviato un esercizio, questo si apre qui in realt\u00e0 virtuale.\n\nRichiede:\n\u2022 HFbioVR installata sullo stesso visore\n\u2022 un account fornito dalla struttura che adotta HFbioVR\n\u2022 una connessione di rete\n\nGli esercizi comprendono percorsi cognitivi (attenzione, memoria di\nlavoro, orientamento spazio-temporale, calcolo) e protocolli di\nrilassamento e consapevolezza corporea. Il terapista pu\u00f2 comporre\nsequenze di esercizi e guidarle da remoto durante la seduta.", "short_description": "Componente immersivo di HFbioVR. Esegue in realt\u00e0 virtuale gli esercizi\nriabilitativi e cognitivi di HFbioVR. Non si usa da solo: l'app HFbioVR\ngestisce accesso, dashboard paziente e catalogo esercizi, e apre qui\nl'esercizio scelto. Richiede HFbioVR installata sullo stesso visore."}]}, "developer_name": null,